{"metas":[{"id":"tt22042292","type":"series","name":"11 Minutes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//6tGsPlNcqDlduY267EP5jMRFnff.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt22042292/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt22042292/img","description":"A four-part documentary that takes viewers inside the heart-stopping stories of terror and survival experienced by those who were at the 2017 Route 91 Harvest Music Festival in Las Vegas.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tmdb:210805","type":"series","name":"Tyler Perry's Zatima","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//mccoy3vzuTHucJXkBL27SqcyAvv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//mccoy3vzuTHucJXkBL27SqcyAvv.jpg","description":"Zac and Fatima take a huge step to strengthen their bond, but new friends and past actions interfere with their blossoming relationship.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt21929812","type":"series","name":"My Dream Quinceañera","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//4UHdgwsRU4WIGYyF8KaNNeMXmyh.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt21929812/img","description":"Three Southern Californian teens – Bayle Delgado, Romi Herrada and Angelica Luna – go through simultaneous fun and drama-filled journeys to celebrate the coming-of-age birthday parties of their dreams while expert quinceañera planner Maria Perez helps make all their quince wishes come true.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tmdb:203489","type":"series","name":"Mike Judge's Beavis and Butt-Head","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//75am8jsmRHHcpIPkm4RyrMn851A.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//75am8jsmRHHcpIPkm4RyrMn851A.jpg","description":"Two teenage heavy-metal music fans occasionally do idiotic things because they're bored. For them, everything is \"cool\" or \"sucks.\"","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt20859150","type":"series","name":"All Star Shore","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//eT8BpxEIJqbBRztWBloHMKfO0bv.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt20859150/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt20859150/img","description":"14 of the world’s biggest reality superstars from some of television’s most iconic series – “Jersey Shore,” “Love Is Blind,” “RuPaul’s Drag Race,” “Geordie Shore,” “Acapulco Shore,” “Rio Shore,” and “Bachelor in Paradise” – come together for an epic vacation at the ultimate shore house in the Canary Islands, to battle it out for a cash prize and global bragging rights.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt20833496","type":"series","name":"Hip Hop My House","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//oJrNJnTSfFbnCpSRjlspoDu5dZr.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt20833496/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt20833496/img","description":"Harlem rapper Cam’ron brings his iconic style to this high-octane hip-hop makeover series with the help of interior designer Zeez Louize. Together they spin one lucky superfan’s crib into a larger-than-life tribute to rap icons, past and present.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt15314636","type":"series","name":"Players","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//n0YH9RlBidJNsSnPmRsV4AqK2m4.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt15314636/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt15314636/img","description":"A pro League of Legends esports team pursues their first championship after years of close calls and heartache. To win it all, they will need their prodigy, a 17-year-old rookie, and their 27-year-old veteran to put their egos aside and work together.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt18271996","type":"series","name":"Yo! MTV Raps","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//3Y2B1WhxHFKlEdmkT7hiDDmY810.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt18271996/img","description":"A comprehensive deep dive into the current state of hip hop, with hosted segments from renowned battle rapper Conceited and celebrated deejay DJ Diamond Kuts, live performances, cyphers and lifestyle content.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt19853304","type":"series","name":"Black Gold","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ooHUE1RkyonmxHQtcUiHlRzZeWD.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt19853304/img","description":"The story of the coverup of the century: of the boss atop a trillion dollar industry who discovered a shocking truth 40 years ago, created a black ops campaign to hide the evidence, and stopped at nothing to keep the money flowing, as the world burned.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt19895990","type":"series","name":"Never Seen Again","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//kmrBPFDAJQVissiHT1xuQr9OlMz.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt19895990/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt19895990/img","description":"Docuseries told from the point of view of those left behind after a loved one vanishes without a trace.","releaseInfo":"2022"},{"id":"tt13236336","type":"series","name":"Sacrifice","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/e8qYQ-QS62ZC4XQ0mgK87iWSa_g=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvMmY1ZjdmYjEtM2NlYi00MTZkLTkwNzgtMDQ2NzAzMWJjOGM3LmpwZw==","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt13236336/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt13236336/img","description":""},{"id":"tt32125269","type":"series","name":"Beyond the Gates","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p28339808_b_v12_aa.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt32125269/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt32125269/img","description":"Tomatometer 100%"},{"id":"tt0115147","type":"series","nam